' Run test: the address book in examples/addressbook, built from its own
' files. Keys: two contacts typed and stored (Enter is Store), Find
' filtering as it is typed and cleared, File > Save (Ctrl+S) writing
' addresses.txt, a contact deleted after its MsgBox, then Ctrl+Q: as there
' are unsaved changes, it asks whether to save, and the script ends there.
Name=addressbook
Startup=frmBook
Form=../../examples/addressbook/book.bas
Module=../../examples/addressbook/people.bas
